Description: GNOME-native MediaTek device client
 Fuse is a GTK 4 and libadwaita frontend for MTK Client. It can read, write,
 and erase device partitions, identify firmware image sources, and perform
 other MediaTek device operations. The MTK Client backend is installed
 separately by the user from the application preferences.
